[l_braz_por.energy_infrastructure]
Rede elétrica reforçada

[l_braz_por.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Linhas de transmissão e infraestrutura reforçadas por meio de um sistema de redundância múltipla garantem que nossas fábricas nunca parem de produzir.

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
Velocidade de construção de §Y$energy_infrastructure$§!

[l_braz_por.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifica a velocidade de construção da rede elétrica reforçada.

[l_english.energy_infrastructure]
Reinforced Electrical Grid

[l_english.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Reinforced electrical supply lines and power infrastructure with a system of multiple redundancy ensures that our factories keep producing no matter what.

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
§Y$energy_infrastructure$§! construction speed

[l_english.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifies the speed of Reinforced Electrical Grid construction.

[l_french.energy_infrastructure]
Réseau électrique renforcé

[l_french.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Les lignes électriques renforcées, couplées à des infrastructures énergétiques de redondance, assurent le fonctionnement continu de nos usines en toutes circonstances.

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
Vit. de construction de §Y$energy_infrastructure$§!

[l_french.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifie la vitesse de construction du réseau électrique renforcé.

[l_german.energy_infrastructure]
Verstärktes Stromnetz

[l_german.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Dank verstärkter Stromleitungen und einer redundanten Strominfrastruktur können unsere Fabriken selbst unter den widrigsten Bedingungen weiter produzieren.

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
Baugeschwindigkeit (§Y$energy_infrastructure$§!)

[l_german.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifiziert die Baugeschwindigkeit für ein verstärktes Stromnetz.

[l_japanese.energy_infrastructure]
強化された電力網

[l_japanese.energy_infrastructure_desc]
強化された電力補給線と電力インフラは多重に冗長化されており、我々の工場はいかなる状況下でも生産を継続することができる。

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
§Y$energy_infrastructure$§!建設速度

[l_japanese.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
強化された電力網の建設速度を補正する。

[l_korean.energy_infrastructure]
강화된 전력망

[l_korean.energy_infrastructure_desc]
강화된 전력 공급망과 다중 중복 구조의 전력 기반시설 덕분에, 우리의 공장은 어떠한 상황에서도 생산을 멈추지 않습니다.

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
§Y$energy_infrastructure$§! 건설 속도

[l_korean.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
강화된 전력망 건설 속도 변동치.

[l_polish.energy_infrastructure]
Wzmocniona sieć elektryczna

[l_polish.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Wzmocnione przewody elektryczne i infrastruktura zasilająca z systemem wielokrotnej redundancji gwarantują produkcję naszych fabryk bez względu na warunki.

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
§Y$energy_infrastructure$§! - tempo budowy

[l_polish.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Zmienia tempo budowy wzmocnionej sieci elektrycznej.

[l_russian.energy_infrastructure]
Усиленная энергосеть

[l_russian.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Усиленные линии электропередачи и многоступенчатое дублирование системы гарантируют бесперебойное снабжение наших фабрик энергией.

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
Скорость строительства: §Y$energy_infrastructure$§!

[l_russian.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Изменяет скорость строительства усиленной энергосети.

[l_simp_chinese.energy_infrastructure]
强化电网

[l_simp_chinese.energy_infrastructure_desc]
强化供电线路与电力基础设施，部署多重冗余系统，确保工厂在任何情况下都能实现不间断生产。

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
§Y$energy_infrastructure$§!建设速度

[l_simp_chinese.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
改变强化电网的建造速度。

[l_spanish.energy_infrastructure]
Red eléctrica reforzada

[l_spanish.energy_infrastructure_desc]
Al reforzar con un sistema de redundancia múltiple nuestras líneas de suministro eléctrico e infraestructuras energéticas, nos aseguramos de que nuestras fábricas nunca dejen de producir pese a cualquier percance.

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor]
Velocidad de construcción de la §Y$energy_infrastructure$§!

[l_spanish.modifier_production_speed_energy_infrastructure_factor_desc]
Modifica la velocidad de construcción de la red eléctrica reforzada.

